# Gardening pathway prevalence styles across habitat types — key findings

Primary data: data/invaded_niche_pathways.csv (632 plots, Barcelona province).
Contingency: habitat x pathway of per-plot alien counts (n.gard/n.unint/n.agfo,
verified to sum to n.total in all 632 rows). 191/632 plots have >=1 alien;
481 alien records total.

